      "reportText": "{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"planFingerprint\": \"sha256:d4b527939ccd0c5ee9d583d67ff36622e270890126c5bb0b1f6564edad57575a\",\n  \"reviewer\": {\n    \"agentId\": \"bc-77bf0e6f-d0fe-437b-a4df-83de0224062f\",\n    \"name\": \"cursor-nov24-independent-mingshi-034\"\n  },\n  \"reviews\": [\n    {\n      \"caseId\": \"sha256:d8e24f4d8f829f94de00e72f03e114df1fae6d2c6bf20eade609a3e00c9a51b9\",\n      \"verdict\": \"approve\",\n      \"canonicalPersonId\": \"per_0NG6SRR9C29WDD4MJC61\",\n      \"membershipReviewed\": true,\n      \"membershipFingerprint\": \"sha256:eff7d4568b69e25b9b0dc9a869389ccf0ce1f8e99d51be66408760046ce31e4d\",\n      \"ambiguityReviewed\": true,\n      \"unresolvedIdentity\": true,\n      \"reason\": \"Mingshi 034 names 王恂 in the Shoushi calendar and ready-reckoner narrative (s0012, s0014). The retained anchor yuanshi:115:p034 is the same graph 王恂 as crown-prince tutor in the calendar-policy exchange (s0075, s0094). Bounded header candidates romanizing Wang Xun use distinct Chinese identities (王珣, 王訓, 王遜/愻) not attested in these primary units; overflow does not separate them. No concrete wrong-actor or false-merge contradiction against accepted membership.\",\n      \"sourceWitnesses\": [\n        {\n          \"localId\": \"mingshi:034:p001\",\n          \"book\": \"mingshi\",\n          \"chapter\": \"034\",\n          \"unitId\": \"s0012\",\n          \"quote\": \"王恂\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"localId\": \"mingshi:034:p001\",\n          \"book\": \"mingshi\",\n          \"chapter\": \"034\",\n          \"unitId\": \"s0014\",\n          \"quote\": \"王恂\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"localId\": \"yuanshi:115:p034\",\n          \"book\": \"yuanshi\",\n          \"chapter\": \"115\",\n          \"unitId\": \"s0075\",\n          \"quote\": \"王恂\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"localId\": \"yuanshi:115:p034\",\n          \"book\": \"yuanshi\",\n          \"chapter\": \"115\",\n          \"unitId\": \"s0094\",\n          \"quote\": \"王恂\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"caseId\": \"sha256:05af3b95589f53b9d353ba1735222b2dacbac9a11ced3786a0fbc4d625ff41ba\",\n      \"verdict\": \"approve\",\n      \"canonicalPersonId\": \"per_1KMTQT0BD5BAXH67NXN3\",\n      \"membershipReviewed\": true,\n      \"membershipFingerprint\": \"sha256:c03e44ce7c2ec0af0416cfb52ddbc6e4816e0c8f6b9024460af45d7d50d231ac\",\n      \"ambiguityReviewed\": true,\n      \"unresolvedIdentity\": true,\n      \"reason\": \"Mingshi 034 attributes posthumous compilation of ready reckoners to 郭守敬 (s0013) with a partial 郭 in the historian's conjecture (s0015). Anchor mingshi:032:p001 is the same 郭守敬 in bibliographic cross-reference (s0007); 郭敬 in s0112 is commentary surface for that astronomer's methods, not a second chapter-local actor. No 郭敬 form appears in mingshi 034 sentences. Retain accepted membership; header 郭敬/Guo Jing candidates are not primary-evidence separation.\",\n      \"sourceWitnesses\": [\n        {\n          \"localId\": \"mingshi:034:p002\",\n          \"book\": \"mingshi\",\n          \"chapter\": \"034\",\n          \"unitId\": \"s0013\",\n          \"quote\": \"郭守敬\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"localId\": \"mingshi:034:p002\",\n          \"book\": \"mingshi\",\n          \"chapter\": \"034\",\n          \"unitId\": \"s0015\",\n          \"quote\": \"郭\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"localId\": \"mingshi:032:p001\",\n          \"book\": \"mingshi\",\n          \"chapter\": \"032\",\n          \"unitId\": \"s0007\",\n          \"quote\": \"郭守敬\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"localId\": \"mingshi:032:p001\",\n          \"book\": \"mingshi\",\n          \"chapter\": \"032\",\n          \"unitId\": \"s0112\",\n          \"quote\": \"郭敬\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
